# Evaluation warnings that attos-ci check-consumers accepts (every other `evaluation warning:` /
# `trace: warning:` fails the check after all hosts were evaluated). One fixed substring of the
# normalised message per line (store paths read /nix/store/<hash>-...), with a comment above it
# saying where the warning comes from and when to remove the line. A line that no evaluation
# printed is reported as a notice; remove it.

# modules/hyprland/nixos.nix and modules/shutdown-hold/default.nix add reloadTriggers to the
# logind unit that NixOS marks reloadIfChanged, on purpose (a reload is what applies logind.conf).
# personal-nix (attodesk, attolap).
Service 'systemd-logind.service' has both 'reloadIfChanged' and 'reloadTriggers' set.

# rust-overlay's lib/mk-aggregated.nix (rust toolchain of honkers-railway-launcher), an input of
# aagl-gtk-on-nix in personal-nix (attodesk). Remove when aagl's rust-overlay pin drops them.
stdenv.isLinux is deprecated, use stdenv.hostPlatform.isLinux instead
stdenv.isDarwin is deprecated, use stdenv.hostPlatform.isDarwin instead
